  (text "Rails: BP1 reservoir · OT centre tap · 6973 plates — BP2 6973 screens, on their OWN supply node (not tapped on the transformer primary) — B1 preamp and inverter rail. The drawing prints no voltages of any kind." (at 12.7 264.585 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "d62ea4b1-1117-5d50-a577-188e50b1af89"))
  (text "Heaters, the mains side beyond the transformer (2 A fuse, switch, mains capacitor, line-reverse arrangement), the neon pilot, the input and footswitch jacks and the two 10-inch speakers are omitted here — see netlist.cir, bom.yaml, layout.yaml." (at 12.7 268.985 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "f0a641b4-c396-5c43-bada-5f824cc5ff0e"))
  (text "The two stubs lettered A are the sheet's own markers on the two output-grid nodes; they are two separate nodes, not one, and the published redraw of the Supro-badged sibling bridges them with a silencing switch." (at 12.7 273.385 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "220b3eaa-5e50-5b77-95fa-374216aed6ab"))
  (text "Channel 2 also carries a 500 pF cut on its plate, and its cathode is node C — shared with the tremolo follower." (at 12.7 277.785 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "74f245a6-a5ad-5b4a-9f15-724270ba1fcf"))
  (text "Power supply — E-3693A mains transformer, 5Y3-GT full-wave rectifier, three cans and two droppers: no choke and no standby." (at 12.7 282.185 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "857fa8d3-b163-5e16-a408-2ed3fbff27f9"))
